%% Implemented backend completion and outbox write.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Autista as AUTISTA assegnato
    participant API as MissionController
    participant Service as MissionService / PricingService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as notifications_outbox
    Autista->>API: POST /missioni/{id}/complete(kmEffettivi)
    API->>Service: verify owner, status, input
    Service->>Service: calculate final cost (server-side)
    Service->>DB: lock and update mission, audit event
    Service->>Outbox: enqueue notification in same transaction
    DB-->>API: commit
    API-->>Autista: completed mission and amounts
